  "uprn": "100023399557",
  "decision_date": "08/06/2004",
  "description": "Erection of a two storey extension to offices, new roller shutter door to service area on ground floor, infill the courtyard to create office space and erection of a side extension with new escape door to warehouse.",
  "site_name": "Konica UK Ltd",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "08/06/2004",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": null,
  "street_name": null,
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Major general industry-storage-warehousing",
  "lapsed_date": "08/06/2007",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - Reason for Approval\r\n\r\nIt is considered that the proposed two storey office and warehouse extension, and the conversion of an internal courtyard to office space, will allow for the sites continued facilitation as an employment premises by meeting the changing needs of its present occupant, without compromising its inherent B8 storage and distribution functionality.  It will not result in any adverse traffic related impacts and has due regard for the sites characteristics and the dynamics of the surrounding built environment, and will not be detrimental to the amenity of the locality or the adjoining properties.  The development is therefore in accordance with Adopted UDP policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development) E.1.3 (Location of General Industry (B2) and Storage and Distribution (B8) Uses) E.1.5 (Development involving the Loss of or Changes in Employment Uses) E.2.1 (Environmental Criteria) T.1.4 (Car and Cycle Parking and Servicing Facilities for Developments) and T.4.1 (Traffic Implications of New Development) of The London Borough of Hounslow UDP, Adopted December 2003; and is also compliant with Council's Supplementary Planning Guidance.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission. Begun.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 4 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used. \r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 5 - The office floorspace contained within the development hereby approved shall be used only as offices ancillary to the main use of the premises as a storage and distribution warehouse and shall not be used for any other purpose or sublet to a third party as a separate unit.\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 6 - No additional office floorspace shall be formed within the buildings hereby permitted without prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 7 - No fans, louvres, ducts or other external plant shall be installed without the prior approval of the Local Planning Authority.\r\n\r\nREASON\r\nTo protect the visual amenities of the area.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 8 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on site outside the hours of 8am to 6pm Mondays to Friday and 9am to 1pm on Saturdays.\r\n\r\n"
  ],
